        "intro": "<p>TOG (Thermal Overall Grade) measures how warm a sleep bag keeps your baby. The right TOG depends on your room temperature — not the season. The ideal sleep temperature is 65–68°F (18–20°C). Set your nursery temperature below and we'll show you the weight, the layer underneath, and the bags that match.</p>",
